 ],
 "content": "3 signs you're ridiculously confident like RDJ. Emily. Robert is comfortable breaking convention. He's willing to risk looking weird in order to come off as funny. I don't see you smiling. Let me see your there we go, buddy. If we do it together, the world's a better place. He inspires collective positivity. He turns a specific request for him into something that everyone can participate in. I'd like to thank my terrible childhood and the Academy in that order. Robert also owns his own story. He can talk about the past without needing anyone to feel sorry for him. So Robert Downey Jr. is authority charisma supported by visionary charisma. If you have the same charisma styles as Robert, you can copy his behaviors and it will feel natural. But otherwise it might feel weird. So you want to copy someone's behaviors who has the same charisma styles as you. If you want to find your charisma styles, I built you a quiz. Comment STYLE below and I'll send it your way. And follow to become a more charismatic communicator.",
